      "id": "dd927abb-df25-574f-a39b-1a1b1bf1ecc8",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Faceless vertical video from an idea\n\nGive it a channel topic (and an idea, or let it pick one). A chat model plans one vertical shot with a narrator line, a video model makes the 9:16 video with sound, the file is saved to your Google Drive and a row with the title, caption, link and cost is added to your Google Sheet. Run it by hand or let it run every day.\n\n### Set up (5 minutes)\n1. Get an API key at [martllm.com](https://martllm.com/go/n8n-faceless-video) and add credit.\n2. Open **Write the video plan** → Credential → Create new → **Header Auth**:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer ` followed by your key\n   Every MartLLM step uses this one credential.\n3. Open **Save to Google Drive**, connect your Google account and pick the folder.\n4. Make a Google Sheet whose first row has these column names: `Date`, `Idea`, `Title`, `Caption`, `Hashtags`, `Video link`, `Seconds`, `Cost (USD)`, `Model`. Open **Add a row to Google Sheets**, connect your Google account and pick that sheet.\n5. Write your channel topic in **Settings**, then click **Execute workflow**. Turn the workflow on to make one video every day at 9:00.\n\n### What it costs\nThe workflow asks MartLLM for the price before it starts and stops if it is above `max_cost_usd`. On 2026-11-25 the price list showed $0.085 per second at 720p and $0.039 per second at 480p for the default model, so 8 seconds was about $0.68 or $0.31. The plan costs a fraction of a cent. A video that is not made costs nothing. Live prices: [martllm.com/models](https://martllm.com/models?type=video).",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 400
      },
      "name": "Note: start here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ba3d5b7e-1dc4-5ea0-a84b-4e1770344abf",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Change it here\n**Settings** holds the channel topic, an optional idea, the look, length (5 to 15 seconds), 480p or 720p, voice on or off, the video model with a backup, and the most one video may cost.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "Note: settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d34511ee-4812-509f-a384-6672261b1c57",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Price first, then the video\n**Check the price** asks what this exact video costs. Nothing is made and nothing is charged for asking. If the price is above your limit, or MartLLM refuses the request, the workflow stops here and shows MartLLM's own message.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 3
      },
      "name": "Note: price",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "88805f08-c612-51d3-a9af-b52fa9903f92",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Waiting for the video\nMost videos take 1 to 5 minutes. The workflow checks every 20 seconds and stops waiting after 15 minutes (the video still finishes and shows in your MartLLM dashboard). If no provider is free, MartLLM retries by itself first.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 6
      },
      "name": "Note: waiting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b34216f6-fde9-524e-ac64-a862f7906153",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Where it goes\nThe file goes to Google Drive, because the MartLLM link needs your key and is kept for about 3 hours. The sheet row holds the Drive link. To post the video too, add a YouTube, TikTok or Instagram step after **Remember this video**.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Note: after",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2800,
        -60
      ]
    }
